      "content": "i get that, but it just seems like it would take forever to see a difference with just the small dose. if she takes more, shouldn't her levels get back to normal quicker? if the doctor said she needs iron, isn't it basically just like a vitamin where more helps more? i just feel like i'm wasting time with the slow approach.",
